{"ref": "Taanit 23a:7", "heRef": "תענית כ״ג א:ז׳", "sectionRef": "Taanit 23a", "indexTitle": "Taanit", "heIndexTitle": "תענית", "categories": ["Talmud", "Bavli", "Seder Moed"], "next": "Taanit 23b", "sectionNames": ["Daf", "Line"], "versions": [{"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Wikisource Talmud Bavli", "license": "CC-BY-SA", "versionSource": "http://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%AA%D7%9C%D7%9E%D7%95%D7%93_%D7%91%D7%91%D7%9C%D7%99", "text": "אמר לפניו לא כך שאלתי אלא גשמי רצון ברכה ונדבה ירדו כתיקנן עד שעלו כל העם להר הבית מפני הגשמים אמרו לו רבי כשם שהתפללת שירדו כך התפלל וילכו להם אמר להם כך מקובלני שאין מתפללין על רוב הטובה"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "Sefaria Community Translation", "license": "CC0", "versionSource": "https://www.sefaria.org", "text": "He said before Him \"I did not ask for this, but for rains of grace, blessing, and abundance.\" It fell as he decreed until the whole nation went up to the Temple Mount on account of the rains. They said to him \"Rabbi, just as you prayed for it to fall, pray for it to go away.\" He said to them, \"I have a tradition that we don't pray about excess goodness."}], "available_versions": [{"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic", "license": "CC-BY-NC", "versionSource": "http://sefaria.org"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "William Davidson Edition - English", "license": "CC-BY-NC", "versionSource": "https://korenpub.com/collections/the-noe-edition-koren-talmud-bavli-1"}, {"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Wikisource Talmud Bavli", "license": "CC-BY-SA", "versionSource": "http://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%AA%D7%9C%D7%9E%D7%95%D7%93_%D7%91%D7%91%D7%9C%D7%99"}, {"language": "en", "languageF